# Allow-list (design §11.2): only what the build copies. Keeps tests, docs, .git, .claude,
# keys, .env files, Terraform state and spike output out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!README.md
!src/
# Inside src/: never bytecode caches or key material, even if a developer left some there.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jwk
**/*.p12
**/.env*
